== r3.99: Use is not transitive. Main uses Bank.Reports, which uses
== Bank.Accounts; Main does not see Bank.Accounts until it uses it.
Use Bank.Reports

Main :
    PutLn(Report(1))
    PutLn(Fee(10))
;
